    I have written two graphics games for the SUNs this summer,
and would like to give out the sources to spread my fame :-).

    The two games are called spacer and cent, spacer is a space-
shoot-em-up game (vaguely reminicent of defender), and cent is
loosely modeled after centipede.

    Spacer runs under V1.1 SUN 4.4 outside of the window system.
(It cannot run under suntools, as it uses the pixrect graphics
facilities).

    Cent runs under suntools and is slower, although, I think,
still playable.

    Anyone interested in a copy of either/or both of these games,
should write to me, and I'll be happy to send out a copy of the
sources.

    I will be away for the next couple of months, so I may be a 
bit slow in responding to your letter, but I will, eventually,
get back to you.

